title: WakeUp_Dream
---
// Said when he gets up in the grass, with his family around him. The credits roll when it ends.
Me: ...
Me: Was it all a dream?
Mother: Yes, sweetie. You ate a whole chocolate cake all by yourself. No wonder you had nightmares.
Me: Mom, I'm sorry... I never meant to hurt you over some lucky number...
Mother: Aww, sweetie, it was never about the number...
Mother: Undoubted belief is what made you win.
Me: Thanks, Mom...
Me: Where's Dad?
Grandma: Your uncle won the lottery. Your father went to beat him up and take the ticket.
Me: Oh my God!
Me: He can't beat him up alone. I have to go help him!
Grandma: The Chips blood boils inside of my Cookie...
Grandma: That's all, folks!
===